failure.message:
AssertionError: 登出后原 Token 仍可访问受保护接口：HTTP 200, {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"total": 1, "items": [{"id": 1, "orderNo": "SO202609180001", "userId": 2, "userName": "alice", "productId": 1, "productTitle": "无线蓝牙耳机", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 1990, "totalAmount": 3980, "status": "created", "receiverPhone": "13800138002", "address": "兰州市城关区天水南路222号", "createdAt": "2026-09-18T09:20:00Z", "paidAt": null}]}}
assert 200 in (401, 403)
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: /api/users/3 应拒绝普通用户访问，实际 HTTP 200: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"id": 3, "username": "bob", "realName": "李波", "phone": "13800138003", "role": "user", "createdAt": "2026-09-01T08:00:00Z"}}
assert 200 in (401, 403)
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: /api/orders/2 应拒绝普通用户访问，实际 HTTP 200: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"id": 2, "orderNo": "SO202609200002", "userId": 3, "userName": "bob", "productId": 2, "productTitle": "机械键盘 87 键", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 12900, "totalAmount": 12900, "status": "paid", "receiverPhone": "13800138003", "address": "兰州市安宁区安宁西路88号", "createdAt": "2026-09-20T13:05:00Z", "paidAt": "2026-09-20T13:06:12Z"}}
assert 200 in (401, 403)
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: quantity=-1 应被拒绝，实际 HTTP 201: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"id": 3, "orderNo": "SO202611250003", "productId": 1, "productTitle": "无线蓝牙耳机", "quantity": -1, "unitPrice": 1990, "totalAmount": -1989.9999999999998, "status": "created", "receiverPhone": "13800138002", "address": "兰州市城关区天水南路222号", "createdAt": "2026-11-25T05:13:06Z"}}
assert 201 in (400, 422)
 +  where 201 = <Response [201]>.status_code

AssertionError: Bob 不得支付 Alice 的订单，实际 HTTP 200: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"paymentId": "PAY202611250002", "orderId": 1, "amount": 3980, "status": "paid", "paidAt": "2026-11-25T05:13:07Z"}}
assert 200 == 403
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: 
  支付回调安全测试失败！
  HTTP 状态码：200
  接口响应：{"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"orderId": 1, "status": "paid"}}
  回调前订单：{'status': 'created', 'paid_at': None}
  回调后订单：{'status': 'paid', 'paid_at': '2026-11-25T05:13:09Z'}
  是否拒绝请求：False
  订单状态是否保持不变：False
assert (False)

AssertionError: 普通用户不应修改其他卖家的商品，实际 HTTP 200: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"id": 1, "status": "off"}}
assert 200 == 403
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: pageSize=0 应返回 HTTP 400，实际为 200: {"code": 0, "message": "ok", "data": {"total": 11, "page": 1, "pageSize": 0, "items": []}}
assert 200 == 400
 +  where 200 = <Response [200]>.status_code

AssertionError: 非数字商品 ID 应返回 HTTP 400，实际为 500: {"code": 50000, "message": "服务内部错误", "data": null}
assert 500 == 400
 +  where 500 = <Response [500]>.status_code
